child up for a long and difficult life. Fortunately, Azothic Memory can fill in a lot of the blanks.<br /> <br /> Your new Tammuz, if they have no creator to fall back on, is going to have to rely almost exclusively on Azothic Memory, so they'll have a rough idea of what they are and what that means, as well as a good portion of the ins and outs of their state, but basically no idea about anything else. Tammuz in particular have a curious relationship to language, with their splat-section mentioning that some prefer to be almost non-verbal until they can master language. Other Created are liable to start talking relatively soon after creation, while a Tammuz will stay quiet- watching and learning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T19:34:34-07:00","id":989151,"title":"","content":"The coolest part of that scenario is that you could have the PCs interactions with him end up shaping his personality. If the players are dicks to him, for example...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}